    <string name="dossier_panel_provenance">PROVENANCE</string>
    <string name="dossier_provenance_wifi">SSID/BSSID/frequency/channel/bandwidth/security: raw WifiManager ScanResult values. Distance: RSSI path-loss model estimate (assumed PTX -40dBm, n=2.5), not measured. Bearing: MAC-hash placeholder estimate; phones lack AoA hardware, see the bearing panel for rotational inference. Noise floor: constant -92dBm assumption. Vendor: built-in OUI table, unknown when unmatched.</string>
    <string name="dossier_provenance_bt">MAC/name/class/bond/link: raw BluetoothDevice values. Advertising data: raw ScanRecord capture (missing fields shown as —). Distance: RSSI path-loss model estimate (advertised PTX or assumed -59dBm, n=2.5), not measured. Bearing: MAC-hash placeholder estimate; see the bearing panel for rotational inference.</string>
